WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.990
The oldest light.

00:01.643 --> 00:03.973
The sphere is the edge of what can be seen at all.

00:04.392 --> 00:15.656
The microwave background, light released about 380 000 years after the Big Bang, reaches us from this surface, now 46.5 billion light-years away.

00:16.200 --> 00:18.315
It is a horizon around us, not a wall.

00:18.856 --> 00:20.264
Every place has its own.
